      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CINQUE STELLE (2) is a very exciting mare, sprinting away with authority last start to win by 3.4L. Out to the mile now looks no issue and she can raise the bar once again with Pike sticking from a good draw. Looking for the hat-trick and she can continue her rise through the ranks. VEXATIOUS ROSE (8) couldn't make it a hat-trick of wins at this track and trip last time, finishing nicely to finish 1.1L off the winner. Two winners have come out of that since and O'Donnell sticks from a better draw. Right down in the weights here and she can put her best foot forward. HEAVEN SPECIFIED (3) got the job done third-up when finishing over the top to score a fortnight ago. Out to the mike for the first time is a good move and he maps to get every chance from he inside draw. Won't be far away. COSMIC WALTZ (7) is racing in good order and can feature again. OUR MATE ARCHIE (1) can improve coming back in trip.",
